{"id":"n85984-1-11","stage":5,"title":"통상 · 通商","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85984-1-11-1","ko":"역사적 기록을 살펴보면 천 년 전에도 외국과의 통상 기록이 있어.","zh":"从历史记载来看，一千年前就已经有与外国的贸易记录了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역사적","meaning":"历史的","explanation":"역사적：历史的","readings":[{"term":"역사적","audio":"/audio/fa887ed9495a94fca035.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71147","senseId":"1","lemma":"역사적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기록을","meaning":"记录","explanation":"기록：记录；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기록","audio":"/audio/6e8b375a38c1e33c5a54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32499","senseId":"1","lemma":"기록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살펴보면","meaning":"考察","explanation":"살펴보다：考察；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"살펴보다","audio":"/audio/b45d19cd4efc5d09e638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67895","senseId":"3","lemma":"살펴보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천","meaning":"千，一千","explanation":"천：千，一千","readings":[{"term":"천","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17167","senseId":"1","lemma":"천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에도","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외국과의","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"통상","meaning":"通商","explanation":"통상：通商","readings":[{"term":"통상","audio":"/audio/9fc77664c060608b7210.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85984","senseId":"1","lemma":"통상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기록이","meaning":"记录","explanation":"기록：记录；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기록","audio":"/audio/6e8b375a38c1e33c5a54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32499","senseId":"1","lemma":"기록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fa887ed9495a94fc","term":"역사적","zh":"历史的","audio":"/audio/fa887ed9495a94fca035.mp3","entryId":"71147","definition":"关于人类社会随着时间流逝兴衰存亡变化过程的东西；或指关于那样的记录的东西。","pronunciation":["역싸적"]},{"id":"6e8b375a38c1e33c","term":"기록","zh":"记录","audio":"/audio/6e8b375a38c1e33c5a54.mp3","entryId":"32499","definition":"主要以留存于世为目的，将某事或想法写下来或以影像的形式保留下来；或指那种文章或影像。","pronunciation":["기록"]},{"id":"b45d19cd4efc5d09","term":"살펴보다","zh":"考察","audio":"/audio/b45d19cd4efc5d09e638.mp3","entryId":"67895","definition":"仔细追究思考。","pronunciation":["살펴보다"]},{"id":"b201938cc759f557","term":"천","zh":"千，一千","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3","entryId":"17167","definition":"一百十倍的数量。","pronunciation":["천"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"6ea4544c8e190594","term":"외국","zh":"外国","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3","entryId":"68121","definition":"本国以外的国家。","pronunciation":["외ː국","웨ː국"]},{"id":"9fc77664c060608b","term":"통상","zh":"通商","audio":"/audio/9fc77664c060608b7210.mp3","entryId":"85984","definition":"国与国之间相互贸易往来；或指那样的关系。","pronunciation":["통상"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/177fec4e7c6f6ca64cf8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85984-1-11-2","ko":"그렇게 오래전에도 외국과의 교류가 있었구나.","zh":"原来那么久以前就已经有和外国的交流了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오래전에도","meaning":"好久，很久；以前","explanation":"오래：好久，很久；전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"},{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외국과의","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교류가","meaning":"交流","explanation":"교류：交流；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"교류","audio":"/audio/791549f8a44f6669c71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30692","senseId":"2","lemma":"교류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었구나.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":